# Serif Headlines

Section titles, module headlines, page titles, and pop-out headlines (e.g.
"What can I ask?", "Add Product Sizes", "Comparing formats side by side") must
use the brand **serif** font, matching the headline style in
`pages/wiseai.html`.

## Rules for the agent

- Never leave a headline in the default sans stack.
- When adding or editing any headline, apply the same serif headline class/
  style used by wiseai.html headlines.
- This is a recurring, non-negotiable requirement — check headlines every time
  you add or move a title.
